me core infrastructure: 3PL fulfillment, DSCSA documentation systems, pharmacy credentialing across 50 states, demand forecasting, and plan contracting. That infrastructure must be operational before the first script is processed."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"ApalyRx has built and operates that infrastructure. The question is not whether to construct it. It is whether your organization chooses to access what is already operational, or to watch other manufacturers establish the direct-to-employer standard first."}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"bg-white","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-content mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-16 md:py-24","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-sans text-eyebrow uppercase text-orange block mb-4","children":"The Operational Model"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-serif text-[28px] md:text-[36px] lg:text-[42px] text-text-primary leading-[1.15] tracking-tight-display mb-12","children":["One New Ship-To Address.",["$","br",null,{}],"ApalyRx Handles Everything Else."]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1.5fr] gap-4 md:gap-8 pb-4 border-b border-border mb-0","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-eyebrow text-text-muted","children":"What the Channel Requires"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-eyebrow text-text-muted hidden md:block","children":"How ApalyRx Has Already Built It"}]]}],[["$","div","3PL Fulfillment Relationship",{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1.5fr] gap-4 md:gap-8 py-6 border-b border-border","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"font-serif text-base md:text-lg text-text-primary","children":"3PL Fulfillment Relationship"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"font-sans text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed","children":"ApalyRx contracts and manages the 3PL. The manufacturer ships to one designated address on the existing monthly bulk cadence, identical to any distributor shipment. No 3PL negotiation, contract management, or operational oversight required."}]]}],["$","div","Per-Script DSCSA T3 Documentation",{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1.5fr] gap-4 md:gap-8 py-6 border-b border-border","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"font-serif text-base md:text-lg text-text-primary","children":"Per-Script DSCSA T3 Documentation"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"font-sans text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed","children":"The manufacturer provides bulk serialization data per current procedures. The ApalyRx patent-pending Distribution Engine generates and retains all per-script T3 documentation automatically. No manufacturer system builds required."}]]}],["$","div","Employer-Direct Pricing and MFN Compliance",{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1.5fr] gap-4 md:gap-8 py-6 border-b border-border","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"font-serif text-base md:text-lg text-text-primary","children":"Employer-Direct Pricing and MFN Compliance"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"font-sans text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed","children":"WAC is preserved across all channels. A per-drug program rebate defined in the supply agreement is applied as a line deduction on the monthly invoice. One invoice, one rebate line, one payment. No new pricing tier, no MFN exposure."}]]}],["$","div","Pharmacy Credentialing Across 50 States",{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1.5fr] gap-4 md:gap-8 py-6 border-b border-border","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"font-serif text-base md:text-lg text-text-primary","children":"Pharmacy Credentialing Across 50 States"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"font-sans text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed","children":"ApalyRx LLC maintains written delegation agreements with all participating pharmacies of record. ApalyRx manages credentialing nationally. No pharmacy relationships to establish or manage."}]]}],["$","div","Cold Chain and Fulfillment Logistics",